{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24580","headline":"樱桃花下有感而作 · 白居易","name":"樱桃花下有感而作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔼蔼美周宅，樱繁春日斜。\n一爲洛下客，十见池上花。\n烂熳岂无意，爲君占年华。\n风光饶此树，歌舞胜诸家。\n失尽白头伴，长成红粉娃。\n停杯两相顾，堪喜亦堪嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}